-- BeeAware Global roadmap — UK Police Force Areas geometry.
--
-- Real boundaries from ONS Open Geography Portal, 'Police Force Areas
-- (December 2023) Boundaries EW BGC' (Generalised Clipped), fetched live
-- via its public ArcGIS FeatureServer (no key needed) and simplified with
-- shapely (tolerance 0.0015) for map display — verified 43 features,
-- matching data.police.uk's own 43 England & Wales force ids exactly
-- (its 44th, 'northern-ireland', has no boundary in this EW-only ONS
-- dataset, so PSNI is out of scope for this choropleth — a documented
-- gap, not a silent drop). See UkPoliceAdapter for the separate, coarser
-- polygon simplification used to query data.police.uk itself.
